    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present this outstanding, extended three-bedroom semi-detached family home with garage, ideally positioned within this highly regarded cul-de-sac just off Ballyroan Road. \n\nExtended to the rear, the property offers well-proportioned and versatile accommodation, complemented by a truly impressive and very private south-facing rear garden. The generous garden also provides excellent potential for further development, subject to the relevant planning permission, making this a wonderful opportunity for those seeking to create their ideal forever home in the highly sought-after Rathfarnham area. \n\nPerfectly positioned within the catchment area of some of South Dublin's most sought-after primary and secondary schools, the property is also within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, including shops, parks, sporting facilities and excellent transport links. \n\nWith its superb location, generous accommodation and exciting development potential, this fine family home is sure to appeal to buyers looking to settle in one of Rathfarnham's most established and desirable residential areas. \n\nThe bright and airy accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming porch and entrance hallway, a well-proportioned living room with interconnecting doors to the dining room, which in turn opens through to a delightful rear sunroom overlooking the rear garden. The kitchen/breakfast room is complemented by a separate utility room and guest WC. Upstairs, the accommodation comprises a landing, three well-proportioned bedrooms, including two generous doubles and a single bedroom, together with a family bathroom. \n\nTo the front, the garden is cobble-locked and provides generous off-street parking for a number of vehicles. To the rear, the impressive south-facing garden is laid mainly in lawn and enjoys excellent privacy, with no overlooking from the rear. It is bordered by a lovely selection of mature plants and shrubs, creating a peaceful and secluded space to enjoy the sunshine from morning till night. \n\nPerfect for growing families, the property is within walking distance of a range of schools at both primary and secondary levels and has great public transport links with the 61 and 15B bus routes running nearby. Access to the M50 at Knocklyon is only two minutes' drive away. Locals love the proximity to the lovely Saint Enda's, Bushy and Marlay Parks and there is a wide range of sporting clubs including St. Enda's GAA, The Grange and Edmondstown golf clubs as well as Loretto and Three Rock hockey grounds all situated nearby. The Dublin Mountains with scenic walks and wide-open spaces are a short drive away also."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nPorch - 0.50m x 1.90m\nWith sliding door.\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.50m x 1.90m\nWide and welcoming entrance hall\n\nDining Room - 3.60m x 3.80m\nWith interconnecting double doors to…\n\nLiving Room - 4.50m x 3.30m\nSpacious reception room with open fireplace and opening to…\n\nConservatory - 4.15m x 2.80m\nOverlooking and with direct access to rear garden\n\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 3.00m x 5.25m\nFully fitted kitchen with tiled surround and open fireplace.\n\nUtility Room - 1.80m x 2.55m\nWith tiled floor\n\nWC - 0.85m x 2.55m\nWith wc & whb, heated towel rail; tiled floor and partial wall tiling\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 3.85m x 2.45m\nWith hot-press off\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.50m x 3.30m\nVery spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.72m x 3.30m\nSpacious double bedroom.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.45m x 2.45m\nLarge single room with built-in wardrobes\n\nFamily Bathroom - 1.70m x 2.45m\nFully tiled, high quality bathroom suite with WC, WHB and bath\n\nGarage - 4.75m x 5.87m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Outstanding extended three-bedroom semi-detached family home with garage</li><li> Highly regarded cul-de-sac just off Ballyroan Road</li><li> Extended to the rear, providing well-proportioned and versatile accommodation.</li><li> No Chain</li><li> Floor area of approximately 135sqm to include adjoining garage.</li><li> Double glazed windows</li><li> Truly impressive and very private south-facing rear garden</li><li> Excellent potential for further development, subject to the relevant planning permission</li><li> Generous cobble-locked front garden with off-street parking for a number of vehicles</li><li> Bright and airy accommodation with delightful rear sunroom overlooking the garden.</li><li> Brick built garden shed in rear garden.</li><li> Within walking distance of a wide range of highly regarded primary and secondary schools</li><li> Excellent public transport links, with the 61 and 15B bus routes nearby</li><li> M50 at Knocklyon approximately two minutes' drive away.</li><li> Close to Saint Enda's, Bushy and Marlay Parks</li><li> Wide range of sporting facilities and clubs nearby, including St. Enda's GAA, The Grange, and Edmondstown Golf Clubs</li><li> Dublin Mountains and scenic walking routes a short drive away</li><li> Ideal family home in a highly sought-after Rathfarnham location</ul>"
      },
